      "writtenOn": "2024-12-13T00:33:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`libfdt` doesn\u0027t seem to support taking in a `String` to create the FDT. At least I couldn\u0027t find a method that would allow this currently in libfdt.\n\nBecause of that, passing a `\u0026[u8]` is necessary.\n\nAs for skip_field/ignore_value, I believe it\u0027s easier to leave it as a `Vec` as we create a `BTreeSet\u003cString\u003e` from it. Any motivation for wanting to change it to a slice?",
      "parentUuid": "f1985b72_e17fa698",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 58,
        "startChar": 18,
        "endLine": 58,
        "endChar": 21
      },
